diff --git a/.changeset/min-age.md b/.changeset/min-age.md
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..cb4fa2a
--- /dev/null
+++ b/.changeset/min-age.md
@@ -0,0 +1,7 @@
+---
+"saleor-dashboard": patch
+---
+
+Regenerate the main schema from Saleor 3.24 and add the minimum age data layer: `Product.minimumAge`, `Shop.timeZone` and `Shop.minimumAge`, `me.isSuperuser`, and the customer `dateOfBirth`, `ageEligible` and audit `events` selections (dedicated customer audited-details query only). All new selections are locked to the main schema.
+
+Customer details read `ageEligible`, the birthday and the audit events in a dedicated query that is sent at most once per customer per page view (never refetched by cache changes), and the customer details queries no longer refetch on every cache change; and the shop settings form blocks saving when the time zone or minimum age is invalid instead of silently omitting it.
